  "title": "PatientMolecularEvidenceRecord",
  "type": "object",
  "x-semantic-rules": [
    "retrieved_date cannot precede available_date",
    "source and raw-data family identifiers are required",
    "ontology IDs require ontology name and version",
    "subtypes require explicit parent verification; verified bindings require versioned subtype and cancer IDs with equal parent and cancer IDs",
    "biomarker term, type, state, specimen, and timepoint are all-or-none",
    "typed biomarker exactness requires observed status and attestation",
    "cohort-context biomarker fields are distinct from the gene-level tested molecular predictor",
    "gene_symbol is bound to a versioned predictor gene ID, feature type, state, specimen, measurement, and curator verification",
